WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.960
Readiness is specific to an activity and configuration.

2
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:07.600
Connect the interface requirements to demonstrated conditions, keep the site and service

3
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.920
evidence in scope, and state unresolved restrictions clearly.

4
00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.560
The record should explain the decision without relying on a family label

5
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.800
or a headline rating.

